    title: "Porsche Coanda and Bleu Mercure Win at Sebring as Bleu Mercure Take the Lead in Both IMSA Esports Classes",
    seoTitle: "IMSA Esports: Bleu Mercure lead both classes at Sebring",
    excerpt: "Both pole sitters win at Sebring in round two of the IMSA Esports Global Championship, and Bleu Mercure Esport now lead GTP and GTD alike.",
    date: "2026-10-02",
