    title: "Thrustmaster's Ferrari 499P Centenary Winner Edition Recreates a Le Mans-Winning Cockpit",
    seoTitle: "Thrustmaster's Ferrari 499P Centenary Winner wheel",
    excerpt: "A limited run of 499 numbered units recreates the cockpit of the Ferrari 499P that won the 2023 Le Mans centenary race, reshaped for sim racers.",
    date: "2026-09-23",
    publishedAt: "2026-09-23T21:35:58Z",
    updatedAt: "2026-09-24T18:29:04Z",
    readTime: "2 min",
    image: "/images/news/thrustmaster-ferrari-499p-centenary-winner-edition/Website_F499P_ProductPageUTH_1580x960_5-1536x933.webp",
